self.KB_CONTENT["card:754574"]={"id":"card:754574","ty":"card","sourceId":"754574","title":"『客戶資料建立作業』中的『TEL NO(二) (MA007)』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"客戶","keywords":["客戶","號碼"],"y":"other","answer":"* 電話號碼二，可空白。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:753809"]={"id":"card:753809","ty":"card","sourceId":"753809","title":"『稅別碼明細表』中的『選擇稅別碼』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"明細表","keywords":["明細表","稅別碼"],"y":"other","answer":"* 可按(icon)或[F2]稅別碼代號查詢，若空白表全部。伍、","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:753610"]={"id":"card:753610","ty":"card","sourceId":"753610","title":"『銷退單建立作業』中的『數量 (TJ007)』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"銷貨單","keywords":["銷貨單","銷退單","訂單","單號"],"y":"other","answer":"* 若輸入銷貨單號，則數量不可大於「銷貨數量」。* 若輸入訂單單號，則數量不可大於「已交數量」。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
